      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2010 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We present the successful use of perioperative non-invasive mechanical ventilation in a morbidly obese pregnant woman with bronchial asthma, severe preeclampsia and pulmonary edema undergoing an emergency cesarean delivery with spinal anesthesia. The combination of non-invasive mechanical ventilation with neuraxial anesthesia may be of value in selected parturients with acute or chronic respiratory insufficiency requiring surgery."
      },
